<title>MALAYSIA: Amoco Chemical sees PTA price rise in Q4.</title>
<headline>Amoco Chemical sees PTA price rise in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of the chemical purified terephthalic acid (PTA) should increase by the fourth quarter of 1996, Amoco Corp's executive vice president for the chemical sector, Enrique Sosa, said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We foresee an increase in PTA prices by the fourth quarter of 1996,&quot; Sosa told reporters. He said that the polyester industry, which had been running down its stocks this year, will be in the market soon.</p>
<p>He did not give a specific forecast for the expected rise in PTA prices.</p>
</text>
